Changelog: 28-11-2026 00:10:28

Added. KytyPS5 Manager, a new app for PS5 games with the KytyPS5-Native emulator, built like shadPS4 Manager. It
installs the KytyPS5-Native release it was tried with, checked against its SHA-256. It reads the VRAM split, the GTT
limit and the three GPU driver options and sets them beside what the emulator asks. It changes none of them. It
finds the games in Games/PS5, reads each title from the game's param.json and adds the checked games to Steam. Start
game, Games Uninstall, Exit KytyPS5, KytyPS5 settings, Steam artwork and the log work as in shadPS4 Manager. The
emulator's GPU helper is an option behind its own pill, which asks first and then asks for your password. The run
wrapper starts the emulator from its own data folder, so the saves never sit in a build's folder. A version chooser
and a Settings tab are not in this version. KytyPS5-Native is written for the AMD BC-250. It is not tried on
PlayStation 5 hardware yet.
